{"text": "As the night went on, the dancing grew wilder, but none of the guests dared to enter the black room in the west. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> At last the clock began to strike midnight, and once again the music stopped and everyone stood still. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Before the last echo had faded, many guests noticed a masked figure that no one had seen before. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Whispers spread quickly through the crowd, and soon there was a murmur of surprise, then of fear, and finally of horror. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The stranger was tall and thin, and he was wrapped from head to foot in the clothes used for burying the dead. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> His mask looked so much like the stiff face of a dead body that even a close look could hardly tell the difference. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The guests might have accepted all this if he had not gone so far as to dress as the Red Death. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> His robe and his face were marked with scarlet spots, the very sign of the terrible plague. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> When Prince Prospero saw this ghostly figure, he shook at first with fear, but then his face turned red with anger. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Who dares to insult us with this cruel joke, he cried, Seize him and take off his mask.", "alignment": {"characters": ["A", "s", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "n", "i", "g", "h", "t", " ", "w", "e", "n", "t", " ", "o", "n", ",", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "d", "a", "n", "c", "i", "n", "g", " ", "g", "r", "e", "w", " ", "w", "i", "l", "d", "e", "r", ",", " ", "b", "u", "t", " ", "n", "o", "n", "e", " ", "o", "f", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "g", "u", "e", "s", "t", "s", " ", "d", "a", "r", "e", "d", " ", "t", "o", " ", "e", "n", "t", "e", "r", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "b", "l", "a", "c", "k", " ", "r", "o", "o", "m", " ", "i", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "w", "e", "s", "t", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "A", "t", " "